# GH-32/ADR-013: docs/, evals/, gates/, stages/, templates/, and .git are
# NOT excluded here (unlike before this ticket) -- baked mode's
# Dockerfile stage COPYs them in as this repo's own doctrine content.
# Mount mode's stage never COPYs them regardless of whether they're in
# the build context, so its resulting image is unaffected; the only cost
# is a marginally larger context upload on every build (RECON.md, GH-32).
